@startuml

hide footbox

title US004 - Register an Appraisal Entity

actor Administrator
participant ":System" as System

' Human communication started by Administrator
activate Administrator

Administrator -> System : **1** I want to register an Appraisal Entity in the system

    activate System
    System -->> Administrator : **2** Provide name and contact for the Appraisal Entity
    Administrator -> System : **3** For the new Appraisal Entity (apEntityXPTO), here's the name and contact
    System -->> Administrator : **4** Appraisal Entity has been registered in the system
    deactivate System

deactivate Administrator

@enduml